xtual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-069-su:p031","chapter_id":"c-shiji-069-su"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m032-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"mio_z5f_ri1","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-069-su:p032","chapter_id":"c-shiji-069-su"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m033-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"mio_z5f_ri1","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-069-su:p033","chapter_id":"c-shiji-069-su"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m033-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"mio_z5f_ri1","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-069-su:p033","chapter_id":"c-shiji-069-su"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m033-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"mio_z5f_ri1","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-069-su:p033","chapter_id":"c-shiji-069-su"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m033-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"mio_z5f_ri1","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-069-su:p033","chapter_id":"c-shiji-069-su"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m033-0124","start":124,"end":126,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"mio_z5f_ri1","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-069-su:p033","chapter_id":"c-shiji-069-su"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m034-0145","start":145,"end":147,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"mio_z5f_ri1","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-069-su:p034","chapter_id":"c-shiji-069-su"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m034-0167","start":167,"end":169,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"mio_z5f_ri1","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-069-su:p034","chapter_id":"c-shiji-069-su"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m035-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"mio_z5f_ri1","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-069-su:p035","chapter_id":"c-shiji-069-su"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji069-025","person_id":"mio_z5f_ri1","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-069-su"],"status":"contextual_provisional","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["大王","楚威王","楚王"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-069-su:p030","quote":"乃西南說楚威王曰：「楚，天下之彊國也；王，天下之賢王也。西有黔中、巫郡，東有夏州、海陽，南有洞庭、蒼梧，北有陘塞、郇陽，地方五千餘里，帶甲百萬，車千乘，騎萬匹，粟支十年。此霸王之資也。夫以楚之彊與王之賢，天下莫能當也。今乃欲西面而事秦，則諸侯莫不西面而朝於章臺之下矣。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-069-su:p031","quote":"「秦之所害莫如楚，楚彊則秦弱，秦彊則楚弱，其勢不兩立。故為大王計，莫如從親以孤秦。大王不從，秦必起兩軍，一軍出武關，一軍下黔中，則鄢郢動矣。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-069-su:p032","quote":"「臣聞治之其未亂也，為之其未有也。患至而後憂之，則無及已。故願大王蚤孰計之。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-069-su:p033","quote":"「大王誠能聽臣，臣請令山東之國奉四時之獻，以承大王之明詔，委社稷，奉宗廟，練士厲兵，在大王之所用之。大王誠能用臣之愚計，則韓、魏、齊、燕、趙、衞之妙音美人必充後宮，燕、代橐駝良馬必實外廄。故從合則楚王，衡成則秦帝。今釋霸王之業，而有事人之名，臣竊為大王不取也。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-069-su:p034","quote":"「夫秦，虎狼之國也，有吞天下之心。秦，天下之仇讎也。衡人皆欲割諸侯之地以事秦，此所謂養仇而奉讎者也。夫為人臣，割其主之地以外交彊虎狼之秦，以侵天下，卒有秦患，不顧其禍。夫外挾彊秦之威以內劫其主，以求割地，大逆不忠，無過此者。故從親則諸侯割地以事楚，衡合則楚割地以事秦，此兩策者相去遠矣，二者大王何居焉？故敝邑趙王使臣效愚計，奉明約，在大王詔之。」"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-069-su:p035","quote":"楚王曰：「寡人之國西與秦接境，秦有舉巴蜀并漢中之心。秦，虎狼之國，不可親也。而韓、魏迫於秦患，不可與深謀，與深謀恐反人以入於秦，故謀未發而國已危矣。寡人自料以楚當秦，不見勝也；內與羣臣謀，不足恃也。寡人臥不安席，食不甘味，心搖搖然如縣旌而無所終薄。今主君欲一天下，收諸侯，存危國，寡人謹奉社稷以從。」"}],"rationale":"按姓名、字稱、遊說對象及嵌入書信局部暫接。蘇代初見燕王、過魏魏王齊王及書信秦王楚王等另存候選，未按歷史年代補熟名；不斷言這些候選必為異人。燕噲讓位段與燕昭王書信分辨，書信內外王稱按引語範圍。穰侯舅與太后母局部暫接，未補姓名或秦王親屬世系。故事家屬與蘇秦家屬分存；全67段明示姓名首輪已存，版本年代、匿名者代詞及其他身份尚待覆核。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:p030","text":"乃西南說楚威王曰：「楚，天下之彊國也；王，天下之賢王也。西有黔中、巫郡，東有夏州、海陽，南有洞庭、蒼梧，北有陘塞、郇陽，地方五千餘里，帶甲百萬，車千乘，騎萬匹，粟支十年。此霸王之資也。夫以楚之彊與王之賢，天下莫能當也。今乃欲西面而事秦，則諸侯莫不西面而朝於章臺之下矣。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m030-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"楚威王","kind":"person","person_id":"mio_z5f_ri1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m030-0119","start":119,"end":121,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、氏族、未名者或未定指代，未補成員、姓名及世系。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-069-su","book_id":"b-shiji-069","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-069-su"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:p031","text":"「秦之所害莫如楚，楚彊則秦弱，秦彊則楚弱，其勢不兩立。故為大王計，莫如從親以孤秦。大王不從，秦必起兩軍，一軍出武關，一軍下黔中，則鄢郢動矣。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m031-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"mio_z5f_ri1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m031-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"mio_z5f_ri1","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-069-su","book_id":"b-shiji-069","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-069-su"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:p032","text":"「臣聞治之其未亂也，為之其未有也。患至而後憂之，則無及已。故願大王蚤孰計之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m032-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"mio_z5f_ri1","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-069-su","book_id":"b-shiji-069","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-069-su"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:p033","text":"「大王誠能聽臣，臣請令山東之國奉四時之獻，以承大王之明詔，委社稷，奉宗廟，練士厲兵，在大王之所用之。大王誠能用臣之愚計，則韓、魏、齊、燕、趙、衞之妙音美人必充後宮，燕、代橐駝良馬必實外廄。故從合則楚王，衡成則秦帝。今釋霸王之業，而有事人之名，臣竊為大王不取也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m033-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"mio_z5f_ri1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m033-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"mio_z5f_ri1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m033-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"mio_z5f_ri1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su